This folder contains an example of the Simple actuator disk wind farm parametetrization  
for a single turbine case. 

Recommended neutral ABL setup (anelastic, MOST, periodic x/y, geostrophic forcing) is in:
  - inputs_neutral_abl_anelastic_1turb

This case is intended to be run with `erf_abl` built with FFT + windfarm enabled:
  -DERF_ENABLE_FFT=ON -DERF_ENABLE_WINDFARM=ON
